{"parse": {"title": "河港与海之间-07", "pageid": 88863, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4-06\" title=\"河港与海之间-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">河港与海之间-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4-08\" title=\"河港与海之间-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">河港与海之间</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.95.85.E4.B9.A1.E6.B8.BA.E8.8C.AB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"故乡渺茫\">故乡渺茫</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 故乡渺茫</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Farewell, Cremona</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>演奏前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>演奏后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">妈妈，我和你。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-520911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-520911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-520911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>现在还来得及……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>越过门槛，踏过甲板，踩过一级级阶梯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回头，回到被抛在身后的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">我们坐于昏暗角落。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再好好看看这座城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它人来人往的广场与它安静古老的小巷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它黎明前轻缓的呼吸，它弥散在空气中，与人群共同震颤的心跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>妈妈……爸爸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我房间窗台上发芽的种子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">我多想悄悄告诉你，飞鸟归巢的故事。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女主人坐在桌前，按下机器的开关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>录音带开始忠实地叙述它所记录的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这是芭卡洛儿的道别留言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>虽然不会离开很久，但我其实还是有点想家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我知道爸爸妈妈要忙着打理作坊，而且有些话确实说出来怪难为情的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>就让这盘录音带帮我说吧，感谢它，这是我认为最伟大的发明之一！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">如一支低哑绵延的乐曲。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……我录制的克雷莫纳的声音，还有来自外面的声音都在里面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你们有空闲的时候，可以听听这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……我爱你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">袅袅不绝，又似我至诚的故友。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>古老的城区总是瞧不见人影，一切都安静地止歇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落在石板上的脚步因而格外响亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>没有多远了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>再穿过两条巷子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>某个短暂的瞬间，她想收回此前的所有决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>让时间往前，再往前，直到那个遥远的、温暖的下午。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她第一次尝试调配琴漆，又把漆涂上了木柜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回到所有道路都未曾向前延伸的童年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">倦鸟归巢，匆匆须臾，当生活的道路将我召唤。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\"><img alt=\"zhongshijijiedao_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/600px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/900px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png/1200px-Cg-zhongshijijiedao_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跑得太快、太急，她需要适当地休息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又或许是因为离目的地太近，让她有一丝犹豫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这次又要放弃做出的选择吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>放弃自由海风号？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>船中午离开，我现在回去拿上行李，和船长还有朋友们说清楚……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>还来得及。到家的时候，应该还能吃上早餐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>手工果酱和烤肠……边缘金黄的面包片……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她蜷起身子，试图在衣摆上把湿润的眼眶蹭干净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天快亮了，但她还没有做好决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">我不能再伴于母亲与家乡身边，在渺茫的夜里再次启程。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenaguangchang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_weiyenaguangchang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_weiyenaguangchang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenaguangchang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenaguangchang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenaguangchang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenaguangchang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenaguangchang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenaguangchang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>广场依旧热闹，小贩、游客与当地人都有自己的一席之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它与平日并无分别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>克雷莫纳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>在街头拉琴的人们还在，还是那几首曲子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忍不住走得近了些，其中一位姑娘认出了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>芭卡洛儿！我们总爱胡思乱想的天才小提琴手！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>你这是要去哪儿？是又参加了哪场演出，还是又在作坊里研究出了什么好琴？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>来，好不容易碰上，要不要试一曲？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>姑娘亲昵地揽过她的肩膀，将手中的琴递给她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧接着，又压低了声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>嘿，用你的名号帮帮我吧，看在我们小时候总一起玩儿的份上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>趁这时候人多，把客人们都引过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>嘿——这不是斯特拉迪瓦里家族的年轻人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>竟然有空来这里为大家拉琴！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许多人早就瞧见了这里的动静，只是远远观望着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这个被大声喊出的名字足够让他们赶紧迈开脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……只拉一首曲子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>之后我还有些事情要做，现在就开始吧。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与预料中毫无区别的掌声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-628020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-628020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-628020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游客：</div><div>多幸运呀～来克雷莫纳好几天了，我还从来没看到过这样……特别的演出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-615601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小贩：</div><div>是吧？先生，你不打算趁机买一柄同样美妙的小提琴吗？或许，您的孩子未来也会成为一名小提琴演奏家呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-628020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-628020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-628020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">游客：</div><div>噢，说的是！我一直很希望能有什么东西激发小家伙们在玩闹之外的兴趣呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有人谈论乐曲，没有人称赞哪段旋律，哪个音节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们只是兴奋地谈论着她手中的小提琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>猜测它用了怎样的木料，又经过怎样的工艺处理，有怎样精心的设计，它的琴箱上又刻着哪位制琴师的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>还给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我们很久没有一块儿玩了，因为我的课程太满，总要练琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>怎么突然说起这个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>谢谢你啦。其实也有我的原因，我不是也没再去找你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>不太好意思嘛，你们家族这么有名，我当时总担心打扰你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>我听说你打算乘上“自由海风号”离开克雷莫纳……那真是吓了我一跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>还好你现在在这里！你可是一位斯特拉迪瓦里！总不能真的去做那种傻事呀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她庆幸地拍了拍芭卡洛儿的肩头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女的肩膀稚嫩，微微发颤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>好啦，我们总有犯糊涂的时候，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺人：</div><div>现在这一切都过去了，我亲爱的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>是的，都过去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>下次再见。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走向那条巷子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>踏上刚刚跑过的路面，经过刚才停留的石阶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——在没有人经过的地方蹲下身子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>总是这样……没有一点变化……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">唯恐黎明让我留驻。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">生活的道路，给予我诗与歌。</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "河港与海之间-07"}}